flowchart TD
  Start((Continue from Part 2)) --> Success[Success page retrieves Stripe session]
  Success --> Own{Session belongs to signed-in user?}
  Own -- No --> Access[Show access error]
  Own -- Yes --> Orders[Customer views own Sanity orders]
  Orders --> Status[View fulfillment status]
  Orders -. optional .-> AI[Groq assistant searches Sanity products]
  AI --> AuthOrder{Signed-in order lookup?}
  AuthOrder -- Yes --> MyOrders[AI order tool reads that user's orders]
  AuthOrder -- No --> ProductHelp[AI product discovery only]
  Orders -. optional .-> Pin[Check six-digit pincode]
  Pin --> Limit{Within in-memory rate limit?}
  Limit -- No --> Throttle[Return rate-limit response]
  Limit -- Yes --> Shiprocket[Call Shiprocket serviceability]
  Shiprocket --> Availability[Show availability and ETA when supplied]
